# Normalise line endings.
#
# The repo stores LF. Keeping LF in the working tree too means the tools that
# write files here (the Tina CLI regenerating public/admin, Next.js, Prettier)
# no longer leave phantom "modified" entries in git status on Windows, and the
# working tree matches what Vercel builds on Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
